    <bpmn:process id="W_W1674" name="W1674. Emergency &amp; Urgent Non-Merchandise Purchase Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Urgent operational need (equipment breakdown, storm damage, safety issue)
Frequency: ~50–100 emergency purchases/month across all locations
Volume: ~0.25–0.5 per store/month (50–100 chain-wide); higher during typhoon season
Owner: Store Manager (store-level); DC Supervisor (DC-level); Department Head (HQ)
Participants: Requesting manager, Finance, Procurement Specialist
Source: workflow W1674 — Emergency &amp; Urgent Non-Merchandise Purchase Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1674_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1674_Lane1" name="Requesting Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1674_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1674_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1674_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1674_Lane2" name="Approver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1674_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1674_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1674_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1674_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1674_Start5" name="Urgent operational need (equipment breakdown, storm damage, safety issue)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1674_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1674_Task6" name="Emergency">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Requesting manager creates emergency purchase request in system: (a) description and justification, (b) estimated cost, (c) urgency level: (i) Emergency — safety or operational continuity threat (e.g., roof leak during typhoon, POS terminal failure, security system failure), (ii) Urgent — significant operational impact if not resolved within 48 hours (e.g., aircon failure in peak summer, forklift breakdown at DC), (d) emergency requests bypass standard 3-quote requirement for items &lt; PHP 50K
Responsible (R): Requesting Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1674_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1674_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1674_Task7" name="Approval workflow: (a) &lt; PHP 10K: Store Manager or DC Supervisor self-approve…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Approval workflow: (a) &lt; PHP 10K: Store Manager or DC Supervisor self-approve, (b) PHP 10–50K: Regional Manager or VP approval, (c) &gt; PHP 50K: CFO approval, (d) emergency flag expedites approval — SLA: &lt; 2 hours for emergency, &lt; 4 hours for urgent
Responsible (R): Approver
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Per SLA</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1674_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1674_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1674_Task8" name="Requesting manager procures from available vendor (often local supplier for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Requesting manager procures from available vendor (often local supplier for speed); submits receipt and documentation for reimbursement or direct payment
Responsible (R): Requesting Manager
Accountable (A): Finance
Duration: Variable</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1674_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1674_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1674_Task9" name="Post-emergency: Finance reviews emergency purchases monthly for: (a) total…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Post-emergency: Finance reviews emergency purchases monthly for: (a) total spend by location, (b) pattern analysis (same location recurring emergencies → indicates need for planned maintenance or capital investment), (c) policy compliance (were emergency procedures followed?)
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1674_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1674_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1674_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1674_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1674_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-343 (ensure controlled execution — Non-Merchandise Procurement Operations (PA-34.1).) | - operational: Store Manager (store-level); DC Supervisor (DC-level); Department Head review and approval gate
Owner: Store Manager (store-level); DC Supervisor (DC-level); Department Head (HQ)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1674_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1674_Annotation11" targetRef="W1674_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1674_Flow13" sourceRef="W1674_Start5" targetRef="W1674_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1674_Flow14" sourceRef="W1674_Task6" targetRef="W1674_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1674_Flow15" sourceRef="W1674_Task7" targetRef="W1674_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1674_Flow16" sourceRef="W1674_Task8" targetRef="W1674_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1674_Flow17" sourceRef="W1674_Task9" targetRef="W1674_End10" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1674_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1674_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1674">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1674_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1674_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1160" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
